Changes for native PianoVideo V5a (copyright Leo Zhang):
  * one opt-in native AVC qualification inventory; no HEVC/encoder inventory;
  * strict proven configuration, complete sample and single-AU ownership gates;
  * native session/descriptor bridge, explicit active/padded linear NV12 layout;
  * macOS IOSurfaceRoot validation, checked copy, async frame/error/cancel;
  * dcan format query, terminal drain and joined invalidation;
  * bounded shared-input snapshot and per-client UUID ownership.
No Apple payload, firmware, VM transport or third-party Linux source is included.
